&lt;p&gt;Join the fourth and final Mapping AI workshop. This workshop asks participants to explore the marginalizing origins and impacts of artificial intelligence. Anita Say Chan will discuss her research on eugenics in big tech and big data. Following the conversation and Q&amp;amp;A, participants will return to the map to investigate where such dynamics play out locally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
